ments<br></li><li>8 different weapons (3 upgrades each)<br></li><li>additionals: companion, rocket, shield, smart bomb<br></li><li>hidden Items for weapons, lives, energy, rocket, companion, bomb<br></li><li>2 player coop mode<br></li><li>3D glasses support (für TV with 3D glasses)</li></ul>",
